{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792647780, "covers_from": "2026-10-22T05:43:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-22T05:44:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792647840, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-22T05:43:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 6, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 45447, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "台北市停車不方便開車到台北很受苦", "display_name": "大安代表 No.45,447", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-22T05:43:06+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 805, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "環境", "content": "想要調整垃圾車的時間。希望可以有白天的收垃圾時間。或是增設垃圾收集站，垃圾車只有晚上來，時間難配合", "display_name": "士林代表 No.805", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-22T05:43:21+00:00", "duration_seconds": 6, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 55507, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "大型車輛視線死角，屢屢導致憾事！", "display_name": "中山代表 Nat（志軒）", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-22T05:43:27+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 41644, "sprite_key": "turtle_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "長照", "content": "對孤獨老人希望有更周全的社區連結，讓老人得到更好地照顧，在生病時有完善的幫助。", "display_name": "信義代表 張心慈", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-22T05:43:39+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 48715, "sprite_key": "turtle_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "醫療", "content": "家人腦幹出血，新光醫生看了說沒救了，用很多話術叫家屬簽放棄急救同意書。\n後續新光無積極治療，已一週。", "display_name": "士林代表 No.48,715", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-22T05:43:54+00:00", "duration_seconds": 6, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 8913, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "交通", "content": "捷運車廂的立柱拆掉對小矮人很不友善🥲", "display_name": "中正代表 No.8,913", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 805,